{
    "title": "Stick Tuber: Punch Fight Dance",
    "description": "Welcome to the StickTuber!\r\n\r\nWe are giving you a basic 2 key fighting experience with sweet, sweet animations and endless action.\r\nYour objective is to fight the never ending waves of stick figures.\r\nSuper easy, Super addictive!\r\n\r\n*Important: The game contains Mild Animated Violence, which may cause Violent Obsession. Consider carefully before playing\r\n\r\nYou should not waste your time looking for others,\r\nhere is what you were carving all this time!\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n*StickTuber has the most basic control ever!\r\n*You have only need to touch your screen when an enemy is near.\r\n*You only have 2 choice right or left, can't go wrong with it!\r\n*(No, you can go wrong with it!)\r\n*Play it with one finger or two finger! No restriction there! Just punch them and enjoy the action!\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n- Lots of songs to satisfy different tastes! Enjoy the DJ and Hop music, relax in epic music!\r\n- Just tap left or right, easy to play.\r\n\r\nStickTuber with Punch Sounds is easy to play! Simply tap left or right gameplay will keep you entertained for hours! Play this EDM music game now!\r\n\r\nIf any music producers or labels have a problem with the music and images used in the game, or any players have any advice to help us improve, please feel free to contact us at hello@zeze.vn",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the StickTuber!<br><br>We are giving you a basic 2 key fighting experience with sweet, sweet animations and endless action.<br>Your objective is to fight the never ending waves of stick figures.<br>Super easy, Super addictive!<br><br>*Important: The game contains Mild Animated Violence, which may cause Violent Obsession. Consider carefully before playing<br><br>You should not waste your time looking for others,<br>here is what you were carving all this time!<br><br>How to play:<br>*StickTuber has the most basic control ever!<br>*You have only need to touch your screen when an enemy is near.<br>*You only have 2 choice right or left, can&#39;t go wrong with it!<br>*(No, you can go wrong with it!)<br>*Play it with one finger or two finger! No restriction there! Just punch them and enjoy the action!<br><br>Game Features:<br>- Lots of songs to satisfy different tastes! Enjoy the DJ and Hop music, relax in epic music!<br>- Just tap left or right, easy to play.<br><br>StickTuber with Punch Sounds is easy to play! Simply tap left or right gameplay will keep you entertained for hours! Play this EDM music game now!<br><br>If any music producers or labels have a problem with the music and images used in the game, or any players have any advice to help us improve, please feel free to contact us at hello@zeze.vn",
